# Agent bootstrap

1. Read root [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) for startup order, product & code principles, and doc map.
2. Before changing code, open the relevant file under [`.agent/rules/`](../../.agent/rules/README.md):
   - layers / Registry / composition → `code-layers.md`
   - tests → `testing.md`
   - types / tools / security / PG migrations → `coding.md`
   - `core/db/pg` / Drizzle queries → `drizzle-db.md`
   - release / Conventional Commits → `release.md`
   - compression algorithm → `compression.md`
   - new packages → `packages.md`
   - 文案语言（无 i18n；UI/docs 中文）→ `i18n.md`
   - frontend features / Habitat RPC vs remote tools → `frontend-features.md`
   - shadcn / ui-kit / Modal → `frontend-ui.md`（规范正文 → [`docs/ui/`](../../docs/ui/overview.md)）
   - 壳子/布局/交互三维度 → `ui-dimensions.md`（产品叙述 → [`docs/ui/dimensions.md`](../../docs/ui/dimensions.md)）
   - Portal 壳 Tauri → `tauri-shell.md`
3. Product architecture (cognitive layers, tools, Gateway) → [`docs/product/architecture.md`](../../docs/product/architecture.md). UI/UX design system → [`docs/ui/`](../../docs/ui/overview.md).
4. Code overrides docs when they conflict.
5. When correcting or refining direction, principles, or philosophy, update the matching doc layer per `AGENTS.md` "Principle & direction maintenance" — same task/PR as code; do not leave changes code-only.
